 "html": "\n<article class=\"bloco\" id=\"r-pergunta\">\n<h2 data-ancora=\"r-pergunta\">Pergunta que quero responder → gráfico recomendado</h2>\n<p><span class=\"selo tec\">Recomendação técnica</span> Tabela de consulta deste guia, construída a partir do repertório de visuais que Knaflic apresenta, somado aos gráficos estatísticos do seaborn. Clique no gráfico para ir ao exemplo.</p>\n<div aria-label=\"Pergunta que quero responder → gráfico recomendado\" class=\"tabela-wrap\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"perguntas\">\n<thead><tr><th>Pergunta</th><th>Gráfico recomendado</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody><tr><td>Qual é o valor deste indicador?</td><td><a href=\"/visualizar/catalogo-de-graficos/#g-texto\">Texto simples (número em destaque)</a></td></tr><tr><td>Como estas categorias se comparam?</td><td><a href=\"/visualizar/catalogo-de-graficos/#g-barras-h\">Barras horizontais (nomes longos, ranking) ou verticais (poucas categorias)</a></td></tr><tr><td>Qual categoria é a maior ou a menor?</td><td><a href=\"/visualizar/catalogo-de-graficos/#g-barras-v\">Barras ordenadas com uma cor de destaque</a></td></tr><tr><td>Como esta medida evoluiu ao longo do tempo?</td><td><a href=\"/visualizar/catalogo-de-graficos/#g-linha\">Linha</a></td></tr><tr><td>O que mudou entre dois momentos?</td><td><a href=\"/visualizar/catalogo-de-graficos/#g-inclinacao\">Gráfico de inclinação</a></td></tr><tr><td>Como o todo se divide em partes?</td><td><a href=\"/visualizar/catalogo-de-graficos/#g-empilhadas\">Barras empilhadas 100% (pizza só com duas ou três fatias)</a></td></tr><tr><td>Como saio do valor inicial e chego ao final?</td><td><a href=\"/visualizar/catalogo-de-graficos/#g-cascata\">Cascata</a></td></tr><tr><td>Como os valores se distribuem?</td><td><a href=\"/visualizar/catalogo-de-graficos/#g-histograma\">Histograma</a></td></tr><tr><td>As distribuições diferem entre grupos?</td><td><a href=\"/visualizar/catalogo-de-graficos/#g-boxplot\">Boxplot ou violino</a></td></tr><tr><td>Duas medidas numéricas variam juntas?</td><td><a href=\"/visualizar/catalogo-de-graficos/#g-dispersao\">Dispersão, com destaque para o grupo de interesse</a></td></tr><tr><td>Quanto Y muda quando X aumenta?</td><td><a href=\"/visualizar/catalogo-de-graficos/#g-regressao\">Regressão</a></td></tr><tr><td>Qual é a relação e onde estão concentrados os casos?</td><td><a href=\"/visualizar/catalogo-de-graficos/#g-conjunta\">Distribuição conjunta</a></td></tr><tr><td>Por onde começar a explorar várias variáveis?</td><td><a href=\"/visualizar/catalogo-de-graficos/#g-pairplot\">Pairplot (só na exploração)</a></td></tr><tr><td>Onde estão os picos em uma tabela de duas dimensões?</td><td><a href=\"/visualizar/catalogo-de-graficos/#g-heatmap\">Mapa de calor</a></td></tr><tr><td>Duas medidas com escalas diferentes?</td><td><a href=\"/visualizar/erros-comuns/#e-secundario\">Dois gráficos empilhados com o mesmo eixo x, nunca eixo secundário</a></td></tr></tbody>\n</table></div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"bloco\" id=\"r-estilo\">\n<h2 data-ancora=\"r-estilo\">Trecho reutilizável de estilo</h2>\n<p><span class=\"selo tec\">Recomendação técnica</span> As funções abaixo aplicam, em poucas chamadas, os princípios de design do livro: sem bordas e grade, títulos alinhados à esquerda e com espaço para subtítulo, cinza como cor padrão (o destaque precisa ser pedido), rótulos diretos e números no formato brasileiro. Copie o bloco das funções para um arquivo <code>estilo.py</code> e use <code>from estilo import *</code> nos seus notebooks.</p>\n<p>O exemplo em matplotlib traz as funções completas e o uso; o exemplo em seaborn mostra o mesmo estilo aplicado com <code>sns.set_theme</code>.</p>\n<div class=\"switch tabs\" id=\"sw31\"><div aria-label=\"Variantes\" class=\"seg\" role=\"tablist\"><button aria-controls=\"sw31-p0\" aria-selected=\"true\" data-i=\"0\" data-lib=\"mpl\" id=\"sw31-t0\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\">Funções + uso (matplotlib)</button><button aria-controls=\"sw31-p1\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-i=\"1\" data-lib=\"sns\" id=\"sw31-t1\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"button\">Mesmo estilo no seaborn</button></div><div aria-labelledby=\"sw31-t0\" class=\"pane\" data-i=\"0\" data-lib=\"mpl\" id=\"sw31-p0\" role=\"tabpanel\"><div class=\"duo\"><figure class=\"figura\"><button aria-label=\"Ampliar imagem: Exemplo do estilo reutilizável (Funções + uso (matplotlib))\" class=\"figura__ampliar\" data-ampliar=\"\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"Exemplo do estilo reutilizável (Funções + uso (matplotlib))\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"671\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/visualizacao/estilo-0.webp\" width=\"1117\"/><span class=\"figura__icone\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icone\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M9 21H3v-6\"></path><path d=\"m21 3-7 7\"></path><path d=\"m3 21 7-7\"></path></svg></span></button></figure><div class=\"codigo codeblock\" data-axes='{\"visual\": [75], \"desordem\": [11, 12, 19, 47, 48, 50, 51], \"atencao\": [4, 32, 41, 75, 77], \"designer\": [41, 48, 51, 57, 72, 78, 80, 81], \"historia\": [26, 28, 40, 78]}' data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python · matplotlib</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python · matplotlib\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\"><span class=\"tk-kw\">import</span> matplotlib.pyplot <span class=\"tk-kw\">as</span> plt</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\">CINZA_ESCURO, CINZA, CINZA_CLARO = <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">#404040</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">#A6A6A6</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">#D9D9D9</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\">AZUL, LARANJA = <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">#1F5FA8</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">#D9731A</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"7\"><span class=\"tk-kw\">def</span> <span class=\"tk-fn\">estilo_explicativo</span>(fonte=<span class=\"tk-num\">10.5</span>):</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"8\">    <span class=\"tk-str\">\"\"\"Estilo enxuto, alinhado aos princípios de design de Knaflic.\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"9\">    plt.rcParams.<span class=\"tk-fn\">update</span>({</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"10\">        <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">figure.facecolor</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>: <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">white</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">axes.facecolor</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>: <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">white</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>,</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"11\">        <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">axes.spines.top</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>: <span class=\"tk-kw\">False</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">axes.spines.right</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>: <span class=\"tk-kw\">False</span>,</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"12\">        <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">axes.edgecolor</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>: <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">#BFBFBF</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">axes.grid</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>: <span class=\"tk-kw\">False</span>,</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"13\">        <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">axes.titlelocation</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>: <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">left</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">axes.titlesize</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>: fonte * <span class=\"tk-num\">1.25</span>,</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"14\">        <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">axes.titlecolor</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>: <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">#262626</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">axes.titlepad</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>: <span class=\"tk-num\">10</span>,</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"15\">        <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">axes.labelcolor</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>: <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">#595959</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">axes.labelsize</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>: fonte,</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"16\">        <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">axes.prop_cycle</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>: plt.<span class=\"tk-fn\">cycler</span>(color=[CINZA]),</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"17\">        <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">xtick.color</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>: <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">#595959</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">ytick.color</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>: <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">#595959</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>,</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"18\">        <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">xtick.major.size</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>: <span class=\"tk-num\">0</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">ytick.major.size</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>: <span class=\"tk-num\">0</span>,</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"19\">        <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">legend.frameon</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>: <span class=\"tk-kw\">False</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">font.size</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>: fonte,</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"20\">        <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">lines.linewidth</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>: <span class=\"tk-num\">2</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">savefig.dpi</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>: <span class=\"tk-num\">200</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">savefig.bbox</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>: <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">tight</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>,</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"21\">    })</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"22\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"23\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"24\"><span class=\"tk-kw\">def</span> <span class=\"tk-fn\">titulo</span>(ax, texto, subtitulo=<span class=\"tk-kw\">None</span>):</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"25\">    <span class=\"tk-str\">\"\"\"Título com a conclusão e subtítulo opcional em cinza.\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"26\">    ax.<span class=\"tk-fn\">set_title</span>(texto, pad=<span class=\"tk-num\">26</span> <span class=\"tk-kw\">if</span> subtitulo <span class=\"tk-kw\">else</span> <span class=\"tk-num\">10</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"27\">    <span class=\"tk-kw\">if</span> subtitulo:</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"28\">        ax.<span class=\"tk-fn\">text</span>(<span class=\"tk-num\">0</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">1.03</span>, subtitulo, transform=ax.transAxes, color=<span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">#7F7F7F</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>,</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"29\">                fontsize=plt.rcParams[<span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">font.size</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>] - <span class=\"tk-num\">0.5</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"30\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"31\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"32\"><span class=\"tk-kw\">def</span> <span class=\"tk-fn\">destacar</span>(barras, indices, cor=AZUL):</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"33\">    <span class=\"tk-str\">\"\"\"Pinta só as barras indicadas; as demais ficam em cinza.\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"34\">    <span class=\"tk-kw\">for</span> i, barra <span class=\"tk-kw\">in</span> <span class=\"tk-bi\">enumerate</span>(barras):</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"35\">        barra.<span class=\"tk-fn\">set_color</span>(cor <span class=\"tk-kw\">if</span> i <span class=\"tk-kw\">in</span> indices <span class=\"tk-kw\">else</span> CINZA)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"36\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"37\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"38\"><span class=\"tk-kw\">def</span> <span class=\"tk-fn\">rotular_fim</span>(ax, x, y, texto, cor=CINZA_ESCURO, negrito=<span class=\"tk-kw\">False</span>):</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"39\">    <span class=\"tk-str\">\"\"\"Rótulo direto ao fim de uma linha, no lugar da legenda.\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"40\">    ax.<span class=\"tk-fn\">annotate</span>(texto, (x[-<span class=\"tk-num\">1</span>], y[-<span class=\"tk-num\">1</span>]), xytext=(<span class=\"tk-num\">6</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">0</span>), textcoords=<span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">offset points</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>,</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"41\">                va=<span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">center</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>, color=cor, fontweight=<span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">bold</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span> <span class=\"tk-kw\">if</span> negrito <span class=\"tk-kw\">else</span> <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">normal</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"42\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"43\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"44\"><span class=\"tk-kw\">def</span> <span class=\"tk-fn\">sem_eixo</span>(ax, eixo=<span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">y</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>):</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"45\">    <span class=\"tk-str\">\"\"\"Remove um eixo quando os valores já estão escritos no gráfico.\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"46\">    <span class=\"tk-kw\">if</span> eixo == <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">y</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>:</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"47\">        ax.spines[<span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">left</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>].<span class=\"tk-fn\">set_visible</span>(<span class=\"tk-kw\">False</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"48\">        ax.<span class=\"tk-fn\">set_yticks</span>([])</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"49\">    <span class=\"tk-kw\">else</span>:</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"50\">        ax.spines[<span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">bottom</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>].<span class=\"tk-fn\">set_visible</span>(<span class=\"tk-kw\">False</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"51\">        ax.<span class=\"tk-fn\">set_xticks</span>([])</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"52\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"53\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"54\"><span class=\"tk-kw\">def</span> <span class=\"tk-fn\">numero_br</span>(valor, casas=<span class=\"tk-num\">0</span>):</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"55\">    <span class=\"tk-str\">\"\"\"Formata número no padrão brasileiro: 1.234,5\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"56\">    texto = <span class=\"tk-kw\">f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span>valor<span class=\"tk-str\">:</span><span class=\"tk-str\">,.</span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span>casas<span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\">f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"57\">    <span class=\"tk-kw\">return</span> texto.<span class=\"tk-fn\">replace</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">,</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">X</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>).<span class=\"tk-fn\">replace</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">.</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">,</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>).<span class=\"tk-fn\">replace</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">X</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">.</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"58\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"59\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"60\"><span class=\"tk-com\"># ---------------------------------------------------------------- uso</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"61\"><span class=\"tk-kw\">import</span> numpy <span class=\"tk-kw\">as</span> np</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"62\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"63\"><span class=\"tk-fn\">estilo_explicativo</span>()</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"64\">meses = np.<span class=\"tk-fn\">arange</span>(<span class=\"tk-num\">1</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">13</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"65\">equipes = {  <span class=\"tk-com\"># tempo médio de resposta, em horas (sintético)</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"66\">    <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Suporte N1</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>: [<span class=\"tk-num\">9.8</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">9.5</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">9.9</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">9.6</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">9.4</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">9.7</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">9.5</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">9.3</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">9.6</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">9.4</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">9.5</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">9.3</span>],</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"67\">    <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Financeiro</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>: [<span class=\"tk-num\">14.2</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">14.5</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">13.9</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">14.1</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">14.4</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">14.0</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">13.8</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">14.2</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">14.1</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">13.9</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">14.0</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">13.7</span>],</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"68\">    <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Comercial</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>: [<span class=\"tk-num\">4.1</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">4.3</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">4.0</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">4.4</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">4.2</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">4.5</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">4.3</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">4.1</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">4.4</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">4.2</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">4.0</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">3.9</span>],</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"69\">    <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Suporte N2</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>: [<span class=\"tk-num\">21.5</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">21.0</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">20.8</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">19.4</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">16.2</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">12.9</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">10.4</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">8.8</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">7.9</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">7.1</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">6.8</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">6.5</span>],</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"70\">}</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"71\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"72\">fig, ax = plt.<span class=\"tk-fn\">subplots</span>(figsize=(<span class=\"tk-num\">8</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">4.4</span>))</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"73\"><span class=\"tk-kw\">for</span> nome, valores <span class=\"tk-kw\">in</span> equipes.<span class=\"tk-fn\">items</span>():</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"74\">    destaque = nome == <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Suporte N2</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"75\">    ax.<span class=\"tk-fn\">plot</span>(meses, valores, color=AZUL <span class=\"tk-kw\">if</span> destaque <span class=\"tk-kw\">else</span> CINZA_CLARO, linewidth=<span class=\"tk-num\">3</span> <span class=\"tk-kw\">if</span> destaque <span class=\"tk-kw\">else</span> <span class=\"tk-num\">2</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"76\">    <span class=\"tk-fn\">rotular_fim</span>(ax, meses, valores, <span class=\"tk-kw\">f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span>nome<span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\">: </span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span><span class=\"tk-fn\">numero_br</span>(valores[-<span class=\"tk-num\">1</span>], <span class=\"tk-num\">1</span>)<span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\"> h</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>,</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"77\">                cor=AZUL <span class=\"tk-kw\">if</span> destaque <span class=\"tk-kw\">else</span> <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">#7F7F7F</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>, negrito=destaque)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"78\">ax.<span class=\"tk-fn\">annotate</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">novo fluxo de triagem</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\\n</span><span class=\"tk-str\">em abril</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>, xy=(<span class=\"tk-num\">4</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">19.4</span>), xytext=(<span class=\"tk-num\">5.5</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">19</span>), va=<span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">center</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>,</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"79\">            color=<span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">#595959</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>, fontsize=<span class=\"tk-num\">9.5</span>, arrowprops=<span class=\"tk-bi\">dict</span>(arrowstyle=<span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">-</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>, color=<span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">#7F7F7F</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>))</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"80\">ax.<span class=\"tk-fn\">set_xticks</span>([<span class=\"tk-num\">1</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">4</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">7</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">10</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">12</span>], [<span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">jan</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">abr</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">jul</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">out</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">dez</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>])</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"81\">ax.<span class=\"tk-fn\">set_xlim</span>(<span class=\"tk-num\">0.7</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">15.2</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"82\">ax.<span class=\"tk-fn\">set_ylabel</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">horas</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"83\"><span class=\"tk-fn\">titulo</span>(ax, <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">O Suporte N2 reduziu o tempo de resposta de 21 para 6,5 horas</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>,</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"84\">       <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Tempo médio até a primeira resposta, por equipe, 2025</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"85\">plt.<span class=\"tk-fn\">show</span>()</span></code></pre></div></div></div><div aria-labelledby=\"sw31-t1\" class=\"pane\" data-i=\"1\" data-lib=\"sns\" hidden=\"\" id=\"sw31-p1\" role=\"tabpanel\"><div class=\"duo\"><figure class=\"figura\"><button aria-label=\"Ampliar imagem: Exemplo do estilo reutilizável (Mesmo estilo no seaborn)\" class=\"figura__ampliar\" data-ampliar=\"\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"Exemplo do estilo reutilizável (Mesmo estilo no seaborn)\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"612\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/visualizacao/estilo-1.webp\" width=\"957\"/><span class=\"figura__icone\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icone\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M9 21H3v-6\"></path><path d=\"m21 3-7 7\"></path><path d=\"m3 21 7-7\"></path></svg></span></button></figure><div class=\"codigo codeblock\" data-axes='{\"visual\": [19], \"desordem\": [8, 12, 25], \"atencao\": [4, 20], \"designer\": [18, 21], \"historia\": [23]}' data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python · seaborn</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python · seaborn\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\"><span class=\"tk-kw\">import</span> matplotlib.pyplot <span class=\"tk-kw\">as</span> plt</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\"><span class=\"tk-kw\">import</span> seaborn <span class=\"tk-kw\">as</span> sns</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\">CINZA, AZUL = <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">#A6A6A6</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">#1F5FA8</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\"><span class=\"tk-com\"># o mesmo estilo, aplicado pelo seaborn</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"7\">sns.<span class=\"tk-fn\">set_theme</span>(style=<span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">white</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>, font_scale=<span class=\"tk-num\">0.95</span>, rc={</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"8\">    <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">axes.spines.top</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>: <span class=\"tk-kw\">False</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">axes.spines.right</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>: <span class=\"tk-kw\">False</span>,</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"9\">    <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">axes.edgecolor</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>: <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">#BFBFBF</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">axes.titlelocation</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>: <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">left</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>,</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"10\">    <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">axes.titlesize</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>: <span class=\"tk-num\">13</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">axes.titlecolor</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>: <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">#262626</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>,</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"11\">    <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">axes.labelcolor</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>: <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">#595959</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">xtick.color</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>: <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">#595959</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">ytick.color</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>: <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">#595959</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>,</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"12\">    <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">legend.frameon</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>: <span class=\"tk-kw\">False</span>,</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"13\">})</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"14\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"15\">gorjetas = sns.<span class=\"tk-fn\">load_dataset</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">tips</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"16\">media = gorjetas.<span class=\"tk-fn\">groupby</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">size</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>)[<span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">tip</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>].<span class=\"tk-fn\">mean</span>().<span class=\"tk-fn\">reset_index</span>()</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"17\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"18\">fig, ax = plt.<span class=\"tk-fn\">subplots</span>(figsize=(<span class=\"tk-num\">7</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">3.8</span>))</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"19\">sns.<span class=\"tk-fn\">barplot</span>(data=media, x=<span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">size</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>, y=<span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">tip</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>, color=CINZA, width=<span class=\"tk-num\">0.65</span>, ax=ax)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"20\">ax.patches[-<span class=\"tk-num\">1</span>].<span class=\"tk-fn\">set_facecolor</span>(AZUL)  <span class=\"tk-com\"># destaque: mesas de 6 pessoas</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"21\">ax.<span class=\"tk-fn\">bar_label</span>(ax.containers[<span class=\"tk-num\">0</span>], labels=[<span class=\"tk-kw\">f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span>v<span class=\"tk-str\">:</span><span class=\"tk-str\">.2f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>.<span class=\"tk-fn\">replace</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">.</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">,</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>) <span class=\"tk-kw\">for</span> v <span class=\"tk-kw\">in</span> media[<span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">tip</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>]],</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"22\">             padding=<span class=\"tk-num\">4</span>, color=<span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">#595959</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"23\">ax.<span class=\"tk-fn\">set_title</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Mesas de 6 pessoas deixam a maior gorjeta média: US$ 5,22</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"24\">ax.<span class=\"tk-fn\">set</span>(xlabel=<span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">pessoas na mesa</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>, ylabel=<span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span><span class=\"tk-str\">\"</span>, yticks=[])</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"25\">sns.<span class=\"tk-fn\">despine</span>(left=<span class=\"tk-kw\">True</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"26\">plt.<span class=\"tk-fn\">show</span>()</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"bloco\" id=\"r-checklist\">\n<h2 data-ancora=\"r-checklist\">Checklist antes de apresentar</h2>\n<ul class=\"checklist\">\n<li>Consigo dizer a grande ideia em uma frase? Ela está no título?</li>\n<li>O tipo de gráfico responde à pergunta da <a href=\"#r-pergunta\">tabela acima</a>?</li>\n<li>Barras começam no zero? Há só um eixo y?</li>\n<li>Retirei bordas, grade, marcadores e legenda que não fazem falta?</li>\n<li>Existe uma única cor de destaque, e ela está no ponto da mensagem?</li>\n<li>Ao olhar o gráfico pela primeira vez, para onde vão os olhos? É para lá que eu queria?</li>\n<li>Os textos estão na horizontal, alinhados à esquerda e com números no formato brasileiro?</li>\n<li>Alguém que não conhece o tema entende o gráfico sem minha explicação?</li>\n<li>A chamada à ação está explícita (no rodapé, no slide ou na fala)?</li>\n</ul>\n</article>\n<article class=\"bloco\" id=\"creditos\">\n<h2 data-ancora=\"creditos\">Fontes e créditos</h2>\n<p><strong>Livro.</strong> As ideias marcadas com o selo <span class=\"selo knaflic\">Knaflic</span> vêm de Cole Nussbaumer Knaflic, <em>Storytelling with Data: A Data Visualization Guide for Business Professionals</em> (Wiley, 2015), publicado no Brasil como <em>Storytelling com Dados</em>. Todas foram parafraseadas; nenhum trecho foi reproduzido. Os exemplos, dados e cenários deste guia são próprios e sintéticos, exceto os conjuntos embutidos no seaborn. Itens marcados com <span class=\"selo confirmar\">a confirmar no livro</span> são detalhes que não pude verificar com segurança.</p>\n<p><strong>Seu material.</strong> Serviram de base: o notebook <em>matplotlib/matplotlib.ipynb</em> (interfaces pyplot e orientada a objetos, <code>subplots</code>, <code>add_axes</code>, <code>figsize</code>, legendas, cores, estilos de linha e os primeiros <code>scatter</code>, <code>hist</code> e <code>boxplot</code>); os notebooks de <em>seaborn/notebooks</em> (distribuições, categóricos, regressões, matrizes, estilos e grades, além do caderno de exercícios); a apostila <em>Visualização de Dados Avançada com Seaborn</em> (Asimov Academy) e o PDF <em>Visualizndo Dados com Matplotlib</em>, que reúne a impressão dos mesmos notebooks de seaborn. Cada cartão indica de onde veio o exemplo original. O caderno de exercícios traz o cabeçalho da Pierian Data, e a apostila é da Asimov Academy: a autoria desses materiais permanece com quem os produziu.</p>\n<p><strong>Ambiente.</strong> Imagens geradas com Python 3.14.7, matplotlib 3.11.1, seaborn 0.13.2, pandas 3.0.5 e NumPy 2.5.2, executando exatamente o código exibido ao lado de cada uma.</p>\n</article>\n",
